### Application Status Management - Comprehensive Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001
@contentType = application/json
@testUserId = test-user-status
@applicationId = f9445729-83a8-4245-b751-15b304771ff9

### Setup: Create a test application for status transitions
# @name createTestAppForStatus
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "Internship",
    "status": "Brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "Status Test Corp",
        "position": "Test Engineer",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01",
        "supervisor_name": "Status Supervisor",
        "supervisor_email": "status@testcorp.com",
        "description": "Application for testing status transitions",
        "requirements": "Testing skills required"
    }
}

###

### 1. Valid Status Transition: Draft to Pending
# @name statusDraftToPending
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "EnAttente",
    "feedback": "Application submitted for review"
}

###

### 2. Valid Status Transition: Pending to Approved
# @name statusPendingToApproved
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "Approuvee",
    "feedback": "Application approved! Excellent qualifications and clear objectives. Welcome to the program."
}

###

### 3. Create Another Test Application for Rejection Flow
# @name createTestAppForRejection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "incubation",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Incubation",
    "data": {
        "project_name": "Rejection Test Project",
        "business_model": "Test business model",
        "target_market": "Test market",
        "team_size": 2,
        "project_stage": "Concept"
    }
}

###

### 4. Draft to Pending for Rejection Test
# @name statusDraftToPendingReject
@rejectionAppId = use-id-from-previous-response
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{rejectionAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente"
}

###

### 5. Valid Status Transition: Pending to Rejected
# @name statusPendingToRejected
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{rejectionAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "rejetee",
    "feedback": "Unfortunately, your application does not meet our current criteria. The business model needs more development and market validation."
}

###

### 6. Create Test Application for Changes Requested Flow
# @name createTestAppForChanges
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "pfe",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Pfe",
    "data": {
        "title": "Changes Test Project",
        "supervisor_name": "Prof. Changes",
        "academic_year": "2024-2025",
        "specialization": "Computer Science",
        "objectives": "Test changes requested flow"
    }
}

###

### 7. Draft to Pending for Changes Test
# @name statusDraftToPendingChanges
@changesAppId = use-id-from-previous-response
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{changesAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente"
}

###

### 8. Valid Status Transition: Pending to Changes Requested
# @name statusPendingToChanges
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{changesAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "modification_demandee",
    "feedback": "Please provide more details in the methodology section and clarify the expected outcomes. Also, include information about the technology stack you plan to use."
}

###

### 9. Valid Status Transition: Changes Requested to Pending
# @name statusChangesToPending
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{changesAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "Thank you for the additional information. Your application is back under review."
}

###

### 10. Invalid Status Transition: Draft to Approved (Should Fail)
# @name invalidStatusDraftToApproved
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "Invalid Transition Corp",
        "position": "Test Position",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01"
    }
}

# Get the ID from response, then try invalid transition
@invalidTransitionId = use-id-from-previous-response
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{invalidTransitionId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "approuvee",
    "feedback": "Attempting invalid transition from draft to approved"
}

###

### 11. Invalid Status Transition: Approved to Pending (Should Fail)
# @name invalidStatusApprovedToPending
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "Attempting to move approved application back to pending"
}

###

### 12. Invalid Status Transition: Rejected to Approved (Should Fail)
# @name invalidStatusRejectedToApproved
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{rejectionAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "approuvee",
    "feedback": "Attempting to approve a rejected application"
}

###

