### 15. Status Update with No Feedback
# @name statusUpdateNoFeedback
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{changesAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente"
}

###

### 16. Status Update with Very Long Feedback
# @name statusUpdateLongFeedback
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{changesAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "modification_demandee",
    "feedback": "This is a very long feedback message that tests the maximum length allowed for feedback fields in the status update system. The feedback provides detailed information about required changes including technical specifications, additional documentation needs, clarification of objectives, improvement suggestions for methodology, enhancement recommendations for expected outcomes, formatting requirements, submission guidelines, review criteria, evaluation standards, and comprehensive feedback on all aspects of the application that need to be addressed before final approval can be granted."
}

###

