###

### 25. Complete Status Lifecycle Test
# @name createAppForLifecycle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "internship",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Internship",
    "data": {
        "company": "Lifecycle Test Corp",
        "position": "Full Lifecycle Tester",
        "duration_months": 6,
        "start_date": "2025-09-01"
    }
}

# Follow up with complete lifecycle: Draft → Pending → Changes → Pending → Approved
@lifecycleAppId = use-id-from-previous-response

### Step 1: Draft to Pending
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{lifecycleAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "Lifecycle test: Moving to pending"
}

### Step 2: Pending to Changes Requested
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{lifecycleAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "modification_demandee",
    "feedback": "Lifecycle test: Requesting changes"
}

### Step 3: Changes Requested to Pending
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{lifecycleAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "en_attente",
    "feedback": "Lifecycle test: Changes made, back to pending"
}

### Step 4: Pending to Approved
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{lifecycleAppId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "status": "approuvee",
    "feedback": "Lifecycle test: Final approval granted"
}

###
